# Local-only placeholders. Copying this file is optional:
# `npm run dev` writes a gitignored .dev.vars with random values when
# PIN_PEPPER or SESSION_SECRET is missing or shorter than 16 characters.
#
# Production (do this by hand later — this repo does not deploy):
#   npx wrangler secret put PIN_PEPPER
#   npx wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET
# Wrangler prompts for the value. Do not pass the secret on the command line,
# do not commit it, and do not reuse the local .dev.vars value.

PIN_PEPPER=
SESSION_SECRET=
